WEBVTT

NOTE Lumen Education — implementation review

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Dana Whitfield>You are four months in. What is working and what is not?

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Ruth Adeyemi>Attendance tracking is excellent. That part sold itself to the heads of year.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:25.000
<v Ruth Adeyemi>Reporting to the trust is still a mess. I export three files every fortnight and merge them in Excel, and the trust has already asked twice why our numbers disagree with theirs.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Dana Whitfield>Disagree how? Different totals, or different definitions?

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
<v Ruth Adeyemi>Different definitions of a half-day absence, we think. Nobody has proven it either way yet.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Ruth Adeyemi>A trust-level report that both sides agree on would save me a fortnight of arguing every term.
